                                            "imageName":  "WukongCloudWalker.png"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "name":  "Defy",
                                            "description":  "Wukong and his twin become invulnerable and defy enemies to attack. All damage is captured, stored, and dealt back in a single furious strike of Wukong\u0027s staff.\nBonus Armor is then granted relative to the damage captured.",
